          "_name": "header18",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"guide-executive-section\" id=\"about-us-story\">\n    <div class=\"executive-container\">\n        \n        <!-- Header -->\n        <header class=\"guide-header\">\n            <span class=\"header-tag\">OUR STORY &amp; MISSION</span>\n            <h1 class=\"header-title\">How ZusammenLeben Began</h1>\n            <p class=\"header-lead\">\n                Bridging professional real estate expertise with genuine human responsibility to support Ukrainian families building a new life in Northern Bavaria.\n            </p>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- General Disclaimer / Notice -->\n        <div class=\"disclaimer-banner\">\n            <div class=\"disclaimer-icon\">\n                <svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"></path><path d=\"M9 18h6\"></path><path d=\"M10 22h4\"></path></svg>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"disclaimer-text\">\n                <strong>Core Philosophy:</strong> We believe that business operations can and should generate profound social value. A property is an asset, but it can also become a safe home for a family forced to leave everything behind.\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Section 1: The Origin Story -->\n        <div class=\"guide-block\">\n            <h2 class=\"block-title\">\n                <span class=\"title-icon\">\n                    <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 22v-9\"></path><path d=\"M12 13c-3-3-8-2-8 3 5 0 7 2 8 6\"></path><path d=\"M12 13c3-3 8-2 8 3-5 0-7 2-8 6\"></path></svg>\n                </span> \n                The Origin of Our Initiative\n            </h2>\n            \n            <div class=\"guide-card\">\n                <div class=\"card-header\">\n                    <h3>From Direct Reality to Action</h3>\n                    <span class=\"status-tag critical\">Personal Commitment</span>\n                </div>\n                <p><strong>The Turning Point:</strong> Behind the ZusammenLeben initiative lies a personal story born from a direct encounter with the reality created by the war in Ukraine.</p>\n                <p>Ben Shamir, a real estate entrepreneur operating in Northern Bavaria for years, was exposed at the very beginning of the conflict to families arriving in Germany with almost nothing—some lacking permanent housing, proper clothing, basic equipment, and sometimes even sufficient food.</p>\n                \n                <div class=\"card-details-grid\">\n                    <div class=\"detail-box\">\n                        <h4>First-Hand Witness</h4>\n                        <p>During the initial period, visits to reception centers and camps housing thousands of refugees made it clear that the need was immediate, urgent, and deeply human.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"detail-box\">\n                        <h4>The Clear Decision</h4>\n                        <p>Faced with people required to start over in a foreign country without language, local system knowledge, or a support network, a clear decision was made: utilize our existing resources to help.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"notice-highlight\">\n                    <strong>Utilizing Infrastructure:</strong> Company-owned apartments originally intended for real estate operations gradually began serving Ukrainian community families. Today, about 90% of the apartments within our activity framework are dedicated to assisting families and community members across Northern Bavaria.\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Section 2: Expanding the Support Envelope -->\n        <div class=\"guide-block\">\n            <h2 class=\"block-title\">\n                <span class=\"title-icon\">\n                    <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"></path></svg>\n                </span> \n                More Than Just a Key\n            </h2>\n            \n            <div class=\"guide-card\">\n                <h3>The Comprehensive Support Framework</h3>\n                <p>We quickly realized that an apartment alone is not enough. A family receiving a set of keys still has to navigate authorities, documents, a new language, school registrations, furniture, food, employment, and daily life integration.</p>\n                <p>Consequently, our activities gradually expanded into a comprehensive assistance network. Depending on necessity and capability, we assist with:</p>\n                \n                <div class=\"three-column-grid\">\n                    <div class=\"guide-mini-card\">\n                        <div class=\"mini-icon\">\n                            <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 13.87A8 8 0 0 1 12 4a8 8 0 0 1 6 9.87\"></path><line x1=\"4\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"20\"></line></svg>\n                        </div>\n                        <h3>Urgent &amp; Basic Needs</h3>\n                        <p>Emergency food purchasing, supplying furniture, and providing essential apartment equipment.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"guide-mini-card\">\n                        <div class=\"mini-icon\">\n                            <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M9 3v18\"></path><path d=\"M14 9h4\"></path><path d=\"M14 15h4\"></path></svg>\n                        </div>\n                        <h3>Administrative Aid</h3>\n                        <p>Assisting with address registration, Jobcenter accompaniments, document translation, and letter comprehension.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"guide-mini-card\">\n                        <div class=\"mini-icon\">\n                            <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M22 10v6M2 10l10-5 10 5-10 5z\"></path><path d=\"M6 12v5c3 3 9 3 12 0v-5\"></path></svg>\n                        </div>\n                        <h3>Integration &amp; Future</h3>\n                        <p>Connecting children to schools and kindergartens, German language courses, and professional career guidance.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"contact-trigger\">\n                    <strong>Continuous Support:</strong> Personal accompaniment continues long after the family enters their new apartment, maintaining deep community bonds.\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- BUTTONS TOP -->\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-buttons=\"true\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-outline-primary custom-btn outline-btn\" href=\"request-assistance.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                        Request Assistance\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Section 3: Business with Social Impact & Working with Authorities -->\n        <div class=\"guide-block\">\n            <h2 class=\"block-title\">\n                <span class=\"title-icon\">\n                    <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg>\n                </span> \n                Business Impact &amp; Cooperation with Authorities\n            </h2>\n            \n            <div class=\"two-column-grid\">\n                <!-- Business with Social Outcome -->\n                <div class=\"guide-subcard\">\n                    <h3>Business with Social Outcome</h3>\n                    <p>We are thrilled to see how business operations can yield not only financial results, but true social impact. Professional connections turn into job opportunities, local authority familiarity streamlines complex paths, and a single conversation helps a parent enroll their child in school.</p>\n                    <p>This integration of business execution and social responsibility is a central pillar of our path, viewing social activity as a natural continuation of our infrastructure and long-standing experience in Northern Bavaria.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Working Together with German Authorities -->\n                <div class=\"guide-subcard\">\n                    <h3>Working with German Authorities</h3>\n                    <p>It is crucial for us to state clearly: the German authorities we work with are a vital part of our ability to help families. We meet professionals at Jobcenters, municipalities, immigration offices, schools, and welfare departments doing complex, dedicated work.</p>\n                    <p>While the system is not always fast or simple, behind it are people striving to assist families. Our activity does not replace authorities; rather, we work alongside them, ensuring families understand procedures and bridge their needs with German municipal offerings.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Section 4: A Small Cog in a Greater Effort & Call to Action -->\n        <div class=\"guide-block\">\n            <div class=\"rule-box green-rule\">\n                <h3>A Small Cog in a Greater Action</h3>\n                <p>We know we are just a small cog in a massive network of people, authorities, volunteers, and organizations working for families from Ukraine. We cannot solve every problem or reach every family, but we can do our part.</p>\n                <p>Whether it is providing an apartment, organizing food, connecting with a professional, or translating a document—every action changes an entire period in someone's life.</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"guide-card cta-box\">\n                <h3>Come Be Part of ZusammenLeben</h3>\n                <p class=\"cta-description\">\n                    We invite property owners, business owners, professionals, translators, employers, volunteers, and Northern Bavaria residents to join our initiative. You can help by offering apartments, donating furniture, translating, driving, or mentoring.\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"cta-statement\">\n                    Not everyone can do everything, but everyone can do something. And together, we can create a real change.\n                </p>\n                \n                <!-- BUTTONS BOTTOM -->\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-buttons=\"true\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">                <a class=\"btn custom-btn whatsapp-btn display-4 btn-warning\" href=\"https://wa.me/380637004615\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                        <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z\"></path></svg>\n                        WhatsApp Anna\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary custom-btn\" href=\"request-assistance.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                        Fill Out Volunteer Form\n                    </a></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "vqiTxMHdtE",
          "_anchor": "header18-1y",
          "_PHPplaceholders": [],
          "_JSplaceholders": [],
