                "margin-right": "0 !important"
              }
            }
          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"guide-executive-section\" id=\"services-guide\">\n    <div class=\"executive-container\">\n        \n        <!-- Header -->\n        <header class=\"guide-header\">\n            <span class=\"header-tag\">OUR SERVICES</span>\n            <h1 class=\"header-title\">What We Actually Do</h1>\n            <p class=\"header-lead\">\n                Comprehensive social support for families from Ukraine in Northern Bavaria — free of charge, subject to availability.\n            </p>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- General Disclaimer / Notice -->\n        <div class=\"disclaimer-banner\">\n            <div class=\"disclaimer-icon\">\n                <svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"disclaimer-text\">\n                <strong>Important Notice:</strong> The services listed below are provided on a voluntary basis, subject to our capacity and availability at that specific time. In every case, we strive to tell you upfront what is realistic. We believe it is better to provide an honest and quick answer rather than leaving you with an open expectation that will not materialize.\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Section 1: Housing & Jobcenter (The Big Pillars) -->\n        <div class=\"guide-block\">\n            <h2 class=\"block-title\">\n                <span class=\"title-icon\">\n                    <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m3 9 9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z\"></path><polyline points=\"9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22\"></polyline></svg>\n                </span> \n                Housing &amp; Financial Support\n            </h2>\n            \n            <!-- Housing Card -->\n            <div class=\"guide-card\">\n                <div class=\"card-header\">\n                    <h3>Finding Housing Solutions</h3>\n                    <span class=\"status-tag info\">Core Service</span>\n                </div>\n                <p>Some of the apartments are properties managed directly within our initiative itself. In other cases, we assist in finding a suitable apartment with landlords and property management companies in the area, and we coordinate with them — including explaining the process to the landlord, the Jobcenter's involvement, and exactly what is required of them.</p>\n                \n                <div class=\"card-details-grid\">\n                    <div class=\"detail-box\">\n                        <h4>Who is it for?</h4>\n                        <p>Families and individuals who are currently in our area of activity or are about to move here.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"detail-box\">\n                        <h4>What to mention in your inquiry:</h4>\n                        <p>The number of people and the ages of your children, the city you are currently in, the timeframe in which you need a solution, and your Jobcenter status (if applicable).</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"rule-box danger-rule\">\n                    <div class=\"rule-header\">\n                        <svg class=\"rule-icon\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3z\"></path><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"13\"></line><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"12.01\" y2=\"17\"></line></svg>\n                        <h3>Important to Know</h3>\n                    </div>\n                    <p>There is no commitment or guarantee of finding an apartment. Availability varies greatly between periods and cities, and sometimes there are simply no vacant apartments of the appropriate size in the area. We will tell you this in advance and will not leave you waiting for no reason.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Jobcenter Card -->\n            <div class=\"guide-card\">\n                <div class=\"card-header\">\n                    <h3>Jobcenter Support</h3>\n                    <span class=\"status-tag info\">Bureaucracy Aid</span>\n                </div>\n                <p>General guidance throughout the process, help in understanding letters you have received, assistance in preparing for meetings, coordinating with your caseworker, connecting you to an interpreter when necessary, and support during the apartment approval process.</p>\n                \n                <div class=\"detail-box detail-box-spacing\">\n                    <h4>What this actually includes:</h4>\n                    <p>Explaining exactly what is being asked of you, identifying which document is missing, deciphering the exact meaning of a received letter, and explaining why it is crucial to reply on time.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"rule-box info-rule\">\n                    <div class=\"rule-header\">\n                        <svg class=\"rule-icon\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"></path><path d=\"M9 18h6\"></path><path d=\"M10 22h4\"></path></svg>\n                        <h3>Important to Know</h3>\n                    </div>\n                    <p>Decisions belong entirely to the Jobcenter. We do not guarantee approvals, benefit amounts, or timelines, and we do not provide legal advice. Our role is to make sure you understand the process and arrive prepared.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Section 2: Registrations & Education (2 Columns) -->\n        <div class=\"guide-block\">\n            <h2 class=\"block-title\">\n                <span class=\"title-icon\">\n                    <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M22 10v6M2 10l10-5 10 5-10 5z\"></path><path d=\"M6 12v5c3 3 9 3 12 0v-5\"></path></svg>\n                </span> \n                Registration &amp; Education\n            </h2>\n            \n            <div class=\"two-column-grid\">\n                <!-- Anmeldung -->\n                <div class=\"guide-subcard\">\n                    <h3>Anmeldung (Address Registration)</h3>\n                    <p>Registering your address with the local authority is a fundamental step from which almost everything else derives: health insurance, opening a bank account, benefits, school registration, and sometimes even a proper rental contract.</p>\n                    <p>We explain what is usually required, how to book an appointment with the local authority, and what to do when a document is missing or the nearest appointment is too far away.</p>\n                    <div class=\"notice-highlight\">\n                        <strong>Important:</strong> Requirements and timelines vary between cities and authorities. Our information is general and based on local experience; it must be verified with the relevant authority.\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Schools -->\n                <div class=\"guide-subcard\">\n                    <h3>School Registration</h3>\n                    <p>Assistance in finding an appropriate educational framework for your child's age and language level, understanding the required documents, providing translation, and coordinating with the school.</p>\n                    <p>In many cases, a preliminary conversation with the school staff regarding language classes or educational support is also required.</p>\n                    <div class=\"notice-highlight\">\n                        <strong>Important:</strong> School placement is determined by the authorities and the schools. We can assist in and explain the process, but we cannot influence the final decision.\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Kindergarten -->\n                <div class=\"guide-subcard\">\n                    <h3>Kindergarten Registration</h3>\n                    <p>The number of kindergarten spots in the area is limited, and in some cities, there is a waiting period of months. We assist in understanding the process, registering, coordinating, and exploring alternatives in neighboring cities.</p>\n                    <div class=\"rule-box mail-rule subcard-rule\">\n                        <strong>Important:</strong> We cannot guarantee an available spot, and at certain times, the honest answer is that there are currently none available.\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Translation -->\n                <div class=\"guide-subcard\">\n                    <h3>Ukrainian–German Translation</h3>\n                    <p>Connecting you with interpreters for particularly important meetings — Jobcenter, authorities, school, doctor — and for documents that must be understood with absolute accuracy.</p>\n                    <div class=\"notice-highlight\">\n                        <strong>Important:</strong> Interpreters volunteer their time, and availability depends on their schedules. The earlier you contact us, the higher the chance we can assist at the required time.\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Section 3: Living & Community (3 Columns) -->\n        <div class=\"guide-block\">\n            <h2 class=\"block-title\">\n                <span class=\"title-icon\">\n                    <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 9v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V9\"></path><path d=\"M9 22V12h6v10\"></path><path d=\"M2 10.6L12 2l10 8.6\"></path></svg>\n                </span> \n                Living, Community &amp; Continuous Support\n            </h2>\n            \n            <div class=\"three-column-grid\">\n                <!-- Furniture -->\n                <div class=\"guide-mini-card\">\n                    <div class=\"mini-icon\">\n                        <svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 12V8H4v4\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h20v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4z\"></path><path d=\"M6 18v3\"></path><path d=\"M18 18v3\"></path></svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3>Basic Furniture &amp; Equipment</h3>\n                    <p>In certain cases, we can assist with basic furniture, household items, and initial equipment — beds, a table, chairs, kitchenware. This depends entirely on what has been donated and is available at the time, sometimes facilitated through other families in the community who have moved or upgraded.</p>\n                    <p class=\"mini-card-note\"><strong>Note:</strong> This involves functional second-hand equipment, not new items, and availability varies greatly year-round.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Post-Move-In -->\n                <div class=\"guide-mini-card\">\n                    <div class=\"mini-icon\">\n                        <svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"7.5\" cy=\"15.5\" r=\"5.5\"></circle><path d=\"m21 2-9.6 9.6\"></path><path d=\"m15.5 7.5 3 3L22 7l-3-3\"></path></svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3>Post-Move-In Support</h3>\n                    <p>Our assistance does not end when you receive the keys. We continue to accompany you in setting up electricity, gas, and internet contracts, sorting out health insurance, understanding official letters arriving at your new address, navigating neighbor relations, and learning standard house rules in Germany — a topic that sounds minor until it creates a real problem.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Community -->\n                <div class=\"guide-mini-card\">\n                    <div class=\"mini-icon\">\n                        <svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3>Community Connection</h3>\n                    <p>We facilitate gatherings, local WhatsApp groups, equipment exchanges, and connections between veteran families and new arrivals. Often, the best answer to a question comes directly from a family who went through the exact same experience six months ago in the very same city.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Extreme Cases -->\n        <div class=\"guide-block extreme-block\">\n            <div class=\"guide-card extreme-card\">\n                <div class=\"extreme-header\">\n                    <svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m4.93 4.93 4.24 4.24\"></path><path d=\"m14.83 9.17 4.24-4.24\"></path><path d=\"m14.83 14.83 4.24 4.24\"></path><path d=\"m9.17 14.83-4.24 4.24\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg>\n                    <h3>Extreme Case Assistance</h3>\n                </div>\n                <p>In exceptional situations — such as a severe lack of food, basic clothing, or other urgent needs — assistance is provided according to our capacity and the specific circumstances of the case. These situations are evaluated one by one and handled in a strictly discreet manner.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Section 4: Summary & CTA -->\n        <div class=\"guide-block\">\n            <div class=\"guide-card summary-cta-card\">\n                <h3 class=\"summary-title\">Summary &amp; Important Guidelines</h3>\n                <p class=\"summary-text\">\n                    <strong>Regarding all services:</strong> The social support is provided entirely free of charge and on a full volunteer basis. There may be external payments required for authorities, service providers, and landlords — these are paid directly to them and are never paid to our initiative at any stage.\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"summary-tagline\">\n                    Not sure if we are the right address for your issue? Write to us anyway — we will tell you honestly if we can help.\n                </p>\n                \n                <!-- BUTTONS (Mobirise Compatible) -->\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn cta-buttons-wrapper\" mbr-buttons=\"true\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a class=\"btn custom-btn whatsapp-btn display-4 btn-warning\" href=\"request-assistance.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                        <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z\"></path></svg>\n                        WhatsApp Anna\n                    </a> \n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary custom-btn outline-btn display-4\" href=\"living-in-germany.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                        <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z\"></path><path d=\"M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z\"></path></svg>\n                        Guide: Living in Germany\n                    </a></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "slider01-2c",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_cid": "vqpqVIly1Q",
          "_PHPplaceholders": [],
          "_JSplaceholders": [],
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "& when not (@fullScreen)": {
              "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
              "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            "& when (@fullWidth)": {
              ".container-fluid": {
                "padding": "0 56px",
                "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                  "padding": "0 22px"
                }
              }
            },
            ".container": {
              "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                "padding": "0 22px"
              }
            },
            ".row": {
              "justify-content": "space-between"
            },
            ".logo-wrapper": {
              "margin-bottom": "1.5rem",
              "img": {
                "width": "(@logoWidth * 1px)",
                "max-width": "100%",
                "height": "auto",
                "object-fit": "contain"
              }
            },
            ".content-wrapper": {
              "margin-bottom": "32px",
              ".mbr-section-title": {
                "margin-bottom": "32px"
              },
              ".mbr-text": {
                "margin-bottom": "32px"
              }
            },
            ".lists-wrapper": {
              "display": "grid",
              "grid-template-columns": "1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr",
              "gap": "1rem",
              "margin-bottom": "32px",
              "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                "grid-template-columns": "1fr 1fr 1fr"
              },
              "@media (max-width: 768px)": {
                "grid-template-columns": "1fr"
              },
              ".list-wrap": {
                ".list": {
                  "padding": "0",
                  "margin": "0",
                  "list-style-type": "none",
                  ".item-wrap": {
                    "margin-bottom": "8px",
                    "cursor": "pointer",
                    "transition": "all 0.3s ease-in-out",
                    "&:first-child": {
                      "color": "@activeList"
                    },
                    "&:last-child": {
                      "margin-bottom": "0"
                    },
                    "&:hover, &:focus": {
                      "color": "@activeList"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            ".copy-wrapper": {
              "display": "flex",
              "justify-content": "space-between",
              "& when (@showBorder)": {
                "border-top": "1px solid @border",
                "padding-top": "16px"
              },
              "& when not (@showSocial)": {
                "justify-content": "center"
              },
              "& when not (@showCopy)": {
                "justify-content": "center"
              },
              "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                "display": "block"
              },
              ".social-wrapper": {
                "width": "50%",
                "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                  "width": "100%",
                  "margin-bottom": "16px"
                },
                ".social-wrap": {
                  "display": "inline-flex",
                  "flex-wrap": "wrap",
                  ".soc-item": {
                    "margin-left": "32px",
                    "&:first-child": {
                      "margin-left": "0"
                    },
                    "a": {
                      "display": "block",
                      "&:hover, &:focus": {
                        ".mbr-iconfont": {
                          "color": "@active"
                        }
                      },
                      ".mbr-iconfont": {
                        "font-size": "16px",
                        "color": "@socColor",
                        "transition": "all 0.3s ease-in-out"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              ".mbr-copy": {
                "width": "50%",
                "margin-bottom": "0",
                "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                  "width": "100%"
                }
              }
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#ff5753"
            },
            ".mbr-text": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            },
            ".list": {
              "color": "#635d60"
            },
            ".mbr-copy": {
              "color": "#ffffff",
              "text-align": "right"
            },
            ".list, .item-wrap": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-btn": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            },
            "a[href*=\"thebwas.com\"]": {
              "text-decoration": "underline",
              "text-underline-offset": "3px"
            },
            ".soc-item a": {
              "display": "inline-flex",
              "align-items": "center",
              "justify-content": "center",
              "min-width": "44px",
              "min-height": "44px"
            },
            ".item-wrap a": {
              "word-break": "normal !important",
              "overflow-wrap": "normal !important",
              "hyphens": "auto",
              "-webkit-hyphens": "auto"
            },
            "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
              ".lists-wrapper": {
                "display": "grid !important",
                "grid-template-columns": "minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr)",
                "column-gap": "16px"
              },
              ".lists-wrapper .list-wrap": {
                "width": "auto !important",
                "max-width": "none !important",
                "margin": "0 !important"
              },
              ".lists-wrapper .item-wrap a": {
                "overflow-wrap": "break-word !important"
              }
            }
          },
          "_name": "footer01",
          "_sourceTheme": "scalem5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"footer01 scalem5\" group=\"Footer\" global once=\"footers\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Logo\" name=\"showLogo\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Logo Width\" name=\"logoWidth\" min=\"50\" max=\"400\" step=\"10\" value=\"150\" condition=\"showLogo\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Lists\" name=\"showLists\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Amount\" name=\"list\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\" condition=\"showLists\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"List Active Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" name=\"activeList\" condition=\"showLists\" selected>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Social\" name=\"showSocial\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Social Amount\" name=\"soc\" min=\"1\" max=\"4\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\" condition=\"showSocial\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Social Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" name=\"socColor\" condition=\"showSocial\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Social Active Color\" value=\"#FF5753\" name=\"active\" condition=\"showSocial\" selected>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Border\" name=\"showBorder\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Border Color\" value=\"#635d60\" name=\"border\" condition=\"showBorder\" selected>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Copyright\" name=\"showCopy\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#0c2c68\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#292325\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.2\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row\" mbr-class=\"{'flex-row-reverse' : reverseContent}\">\n            \n            <!-- עמודת טקסט וכותרת ראשית -->\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showText || showButtons || showLogo\">\n                <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                    <!-- תוספת המקום ללוגו -->\n                    <div class=\"logo-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showLogo\">\n                        <a href=\"index.html\">\n                            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/gemini-generated-image-3uwvbn3uwvbn3uwv.png-171x171.png\" alt=\"ZusammenLeben\" width=\"171\" height=\"171\">\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>\n                        ZUSAMMENLEBEN\n                    </b></h4>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-if=\"showText\">\n                        Supporting integration, housing, and community connection for newcomers and locals in the area.\n                    </p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-white-outline\" href=\"Contact.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                            <span class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-phone mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\"></span>\n                            Contact Us\n                        </a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- עמודות הקישורים -->\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-7\" mbr-if=\"showLists\">\n                <div class=\"lists-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"list-wrap\">\n                        <ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".list, .item-wrap\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"index.html\" class=\"text-white\">Home</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"family-stories.html\" class=\"text-white\">Family Stories</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"services.html\" class=\"text-white\">Services</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"request-assistance.html\" class=\"text-white\">Request Assistance</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"community.html\" class=\"text-white\">Community</a></li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"list-wrap\" mbr-if=\"list > 1\">\n                        <ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".list, .item-wrap\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"living-in-germany.html\" class=\"text-white\">Living in Germany</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"glossary.html\" class=\"text-white\">Glossary</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"learning-german.html\" class=\"text-white\">Learning German</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"refugee-rights.html\" class=\"text-white\">Refugee Rights</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"guides.html\" class=\"text-white\">Guides</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"anna-shishoili.html\" class=\"text-white text-primary\">Anna Cheishvili</a></li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"list-wrap\" mbr-if=\"list > 2\">\n                        <ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".list, .item-wrap\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"how-to-help.html\" class=\"text-white\">How Can You Help</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"social-activity.html\" class=\"text-white\">Social Activity</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"faq.html\" class=\"text-white\">FAQ</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"areasweserve.html\" class=\"text-white\">Areas We Serve</a></li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"list-wrap\" mbr-if=\"list > 3\">\n                        <ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".list, .item-wrap\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"emergency.html\" class=\"text-white\">Emergency</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"Contact.html\" class=\"text-white\">Contact</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"https://wa.me/380637004615\" class=\"text-white\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">WhatsApp Support</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"areasweserve.html\" class=\"text-white\">Location</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"impressum.html\" class=\"text-white\">Legal Notice</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"privacy.html\" class=\"text-white\">Privacy Policy</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"usingtheweb.html\" class=\"text-white\">Terms of Use</a></li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"list-wrap\" mbr-if=\"list > 4\">\n                        <ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".list, .item-wrap\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"text-white\">Privacy Policy</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"text-white\">Terms of Use</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"text-white\">Impressum</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"index.html\" class=\"text-white\">Official Site</a></li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- אזור זכויות יוצרים ורשתות חברתיות -->\n            <div class=\"col-12\" mbr-if=\"showSocial || showCopy\">\n                <div class=\"copy-wrapper\" mbr-class=\"{'flex-row-reverse' : reverseContent}\">\n                    <div class=\"social-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showSocial\">\n                        <div class=\"social-wrap\">\n                            <div class=\"soc-item\">\n                                <a href=\"https://wa.me/380637004615\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"WhatsApp\">\n                                    <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-whatsapp\"></span>\n                                </a>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"soc > 1\">\n                                <a href=\"mailto:zusammenleben.de@gmail.com\" aria-label=\"E-Mail\">\n                                    <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-letter mobi-mbri\"></span>\n                                </a>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"soc > 2\">\n                                <a href=\"#\">\n                                    <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-telegram\"></span>\n                                </a>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"soc > 3\">\n                                <a href=\"#\">\n                                    <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-instagram\"></span>\n                                </a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-copy mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-copy, .social-wrapper\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showCopy\">\n                        © Copyright 2026 Zusammenleben - All Rights Reserved · Website by <a href=\"https://thebwas.com/\" class=\"text-white\">Amit Shechter</a>\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_JSplaceholders": [],
          "_PHPplaceholders": [],
          "_anchor": "footer01-2b",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_cid": "vqpoIpWKp1",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": true,
          "_once": "footers",
          "_params": {}
        }
      ]
    },
    "community.html": {
      "settings": {
        "title": "Our Community in Upper Franconia | ZusammenLeben",
        "order": "10",
        "header_custom": "<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://zusammenleben-ukraine.de/community.html\" />\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://zusammenleben-ukraine.de/de/community.html\" />\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"uk\" href=\"https://zusammenleben-ukraine.de/ua/community.html\" />\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://zusammenleben-ukraine.de/community.html\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://zusammenleben-ukraine.de/community.html\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"ZusammenLeben\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Our Community in Upper Franconia | ZusammenLeben\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Families, volunteers and local partners who make a new start possible for Ukrainians in Northern Bavaria. How to take part and stay connected.\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://zusammenleben-ukraine.de/community.html\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://zusammenleben-ukraine.de/assets/images/gemini-generated-image-3uwvbn3uwvbn3uwv.png-171x171.png\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\" />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"assets/zl/zl.css\" />\n<script src=\"assets/zl/zl.js\" defer></script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"url\":\"https://zusammenleben-ukraine.de/community.html\",\"name\":\"Our Community in Upper Franconia\",\"description\":\"Families, volunteers and local partners who make a new start possible for Ukrainians in Northern Bavaria. How to take part and stay connected.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https://zusammenleben-ukraine.de/#site\"},\"about\":{\"@id\":\"https://zusammenleben-ukraine.de/#org\"}},{\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://zusammenleben-ukraine.de/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Our Community in Upper Franconia\",\"item\":\"https://zusammenleben-ukraine.de/community.html\"}]}]}</script>",
        "meta_descr": "Families, volunteers and local partners who make a new start possible for Ukrainians in Northern Bavaria. How to take part and stay connected."
      },
      "components": [
        {
          "_name": "amenu1",
          "_sourceTheme": "solarm5",
          "_styles": {
            "& when (@sticky)": {
              "position": "sticky !important",
              "top": "0 !important",
              "z-index": "1030 !important",
              "width": "100%",
              "nav.navbar, .navbar-dropdown, .navbar-fixed-top": {
                "position": "relative !important"
              }
            },
            "& when not (@sticky)": {
              "position": "relative",
              "z-index": "1030",
              ".navbar-dropdown": {
                "position": "relative !important"
              },
              "& when (@transparent)": {
                ".navbar-dropdown": {
                  "position": "absolute !important"
                }
              }
            },
            "body": {
              "position": "relative"
            },
            ".navbar": {
              "min-height": "80px",
              "transition": "all 0.3s",
              "border-bottom": "1px solid transparent",
              "& when not (@transparent)": {
                "box-shadow": "0 1px 3px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1)",
                "background": "@menuBgColor"
              },
              "& when (@transparent)": {
                "background": "rgba(red(@menuBgColor), green(@menuBgColor), blue(@menuBgColor), @opacity)"
              },
              "&.opened": {
                "transition": "all 0.3s"
              },
              ".navbar-logo img": {
                "width": "auto"
              },
              "&.navbar-short": {
                "min-height": "60px",
                ".navbar-logo img": {
                  "height": "2.5rem !important"
                },
                ".navbar-brand": {
                  "min-height": "60px",
                  "padding": "0"
                }
              }
            },
            ".container, .container-fluid": {
              "display": "flex",
              "flex-wrap": "wrap",
              "margin": "auto",
              "align-items": "center"
            },
            ".brand-container": {
              "display": "flex",
              "align-items": "center",
              "justify-content": "space-between",
              "padding-bottom": "4px",
              "padding-top": "4px",
              "width": "100%"
            },
            ".navbar-brand": {
              "min-height": "60px",
              "flex-shrink": "0",
              "align-items": "center",
              "margin-right": "0",
              "padding": "5px 0",
              "transition": "all 0.3s",
              "word-break": "break-word",
              "z-index": "1",
              "display": "flex",
              ".navbar-caption": {
                "line-height": "inherit !important"
              },
              ".navbar-logo a": {
                "outline": "none"
              }
            },
            "@media (min-width: 992px)": {
              ".brand-container": {
                "width": "auto",
                "flex-grow": "1",
                "justify-content": "flex-start"
              },
              ".navbar-brand": {
                "padding-right": "20px"
              },
              ".navbar-collapse": {
                "justify-content": "flex-end",
                "padding-top": "10px",
                "padding-bottom": "10px",
                "display": "flex !important",
                "flex-basis": "auto",
                ".navbar-nav": {
                  "margin": "0 -0.5em",
                  "flex-grow": "1",
                  "justify-content": "flex-end"
                },
                ".mbr-section-btn": {
                  "margin-left": "auto"
                },
                "min-width": "0"
              },
              ".desktop-only-flex": {
                "display": "flex !important",
                "justify-content": "flex-end",
                "align-items": "center",
                "gap": "3px",
                "flex-wrap": "nowrap",
                "margin-left": "auto",
                "padding-right": "20px"
              },
              ".mobile-only": {
                "display": "none !important"
              },
              ".navbar-nav": {
                "flex-wrap": "wrap !important",
                "row-gap": "2px"
              },
              ".navbar-buttons .btn": {
                "padding": ".6rem 1.2rem !important",
                "font-size": "15px !important",
                "min-height": "44px"
              },
              ".navbar-nav .nav-link": {
                "padding-left": ".45em !important",
                "padding-right": ".45em !important"
              }
            },
            "@media (max-width: 991px)": {
              ".navbar": {
                "min-height": "60px !important"
              },
              ".desktop-only-flex": {
                "display": "none !important"
              },
              ".mobile-only": {
                "display": "flex !important",
                "align-items": "center",
                "gap": "0 !important",
                "background": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03)",
                "padding": "0 4px !important",
                "border-radius": "20px",
                "border": "1px solid #eaeaea",
                "margin-left": "auto",
                "margin-right": "8px"
              },
              ".navbar-brand": {
                "flex-shrink": "initial",
                "flex-basis": "auto",
                "word-break": "break-word",
                "padding-right": "0.5rem",
                "min-height": "50px"
              },
              ".navbar-logo img": {
                "height": "2.3rem !important"
              },
              ".navbar-collapse": {
                "padding-top": "2px !important",
                "padding-bottom": "5px !important",
                "border-top": "1px solid #dddddd",
                "background": "@menuBgColor"
              },
              ".navbar-nav .nav-item": {
                "margin": "0 !important"
              },
              ".navbar-nav .nav-link": {
                "padding": "0.2rem 0.4rem !important",
                "font-size": "0.82rem !important",
                "margin": "0 !important",
                "justify-content": "center"
              },
              ".dropdown-menu .dropdown-item": {
                "padding": "0.25rem 0.8rem !important",
                "font-size": "0.78rem !important",
                "margin": "0 !important",
                "text-align": "center"
              },
              ".mbr-section-btn": {
                "display": "flex",
                "flex-wrap": "wrap",
                "justify-content": "center",
                "padding": "2px 0",
                ".btn": {
                  "padding": "0.35rem 0.8rem !important",
                  "font-size": "0.82rem !important",
                  "flex-grow": "1",
                  "margin": "4px 15px"
                }
              },
              "nav.opened .dropdown-menu": {
                "top": "0"
              },
              ".mobile-only .lang-link": {
                "min-width": "30px",
                "min-height": "40px",
                "justify-content": "center"
              },
              ".navbar-caption": {
                "word-break": "normal !important",
                "overflow-wrap": "normal !important"
              },
              "button.navbar-toggler": {
                "width": "44px !important",
                "height": "44px !important",
                "padding": "13px 9px !important"
              },
              "button.navbar-toggler .hamburger": {
                "position": "relative",
                "width": "26px",
                "height": "18px"
              }
            },
            ".dropdown-menu, .navbar.opened": {
              "background": "@menuBgColor !important"
            },
            ".dropdown-menu": {
              "padding": "0",
              "border-radius": "4px",
              "box-shadow": "0 1px 3px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1)"
            },
            ".dropdown-item": {
              "border-bottom": "1px solid #e6e6e6",
              "padding": "0.5rem 1.8rem",
              "transition": "all 0.25s ease-in-out",
              "&:hover, &:focus": {
                "background": "@primaryColor !important",
                "color": "white !important"
              },
              "&:hover span": {
                "color": "white"
              },
              "&:first-child": {
                "border-top-left-radius": "4px",
                "border-top-right-radius": "4px"
              },
              "&:last-child": {
                "border-bottom": "none",
                "border-bottom-left-radius": "4px",
                "border-bottom-right-radius": "4px"
              }
            },
            ".dropdown-item.active, .dropdown-item:active": {
              "background-color": "transparent"
            },
            "a.nav-link": {
              "display": "flex",
              "align-items": "center",
              "justify-content": "center",
              "position": "relative",
              "transition": "all 0.2s",
              "&:hover": {
                "color": "@primaryColor !important"
              }
            },
            "ul.navbar-nav": {
              "flex-wrap": "wrap"
            },
            ".nav-item:focus, .nav-link:focus": {
              "outline": "none"
            },
            ".navbar-buttons": {
              "text-align": "center",
              "min-width": "0",
              "flex-shrink": "0"
            },
            ".card-wrap": {
              "display": "flex",
              "align-items": "center",
              "padding": "2px 4px",
              "min-width": "auto"
            },
            ".contacts-menu .mbr-iconfont": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            },
            ".contacts-menu .menu-divider": {
              "color": "#ccc",
              "font-weight": "300",
              "margin": "0 1px"
            },
            ".desktop-only-flex .mbr-iconfont": {
              "color": "@iconsContactColor"
            },
            ".flags-menu": {
              "display": "flex",
              "align-items": "center",
              "gap": "5px",
              "background": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03)",
              "padding": "3px 8px",
              "border-radius": "20px",
              "border": "1px solid #eaeaea"
            },
            ".lang-link": {
              "display": "flex",
              "align-items": "center",
              "gap": "3px",
              "text-decoration": "none !important",
              "transition": "transform 0.2s ease",
              "&:hover": {
                "transform": "scale(1.08)"
              },
              "white-space": "nowrap",
              "flex-shrink": "0"
            },
            ".lang-code": {
              "font-size": "12px",
              "font-weight": "700",
              "color": "#333",
              "letter-spacing": "0.5px",
              "white-space": "nowrap"
            },
            ".flag-divider": {
              "color": "#ccc",
              "font-size": "12px"
            },
            "button.navbar-toggler": {
              "outline": "none",
              "width": "28px",
              "height": "18px",
              "cursor": "pointer",
              "transition": "all 0.2s",
              "position": "relative",
              "align-self": "center",
              "flex-basis": "auto",
              ".hamburger span": {
                "position": "absolute",
                "right": "0",
                "width": "26px",
                "height": "2px",
                "border-right": "5px",
                "background-color": "@hamburgerColor",
                "&:nth-child(1)": {
                  "top": "0",
                  "transition": "all 0.2s"
                },
                "&:nth-child(2)": {
                  "top": "6px",
                  "transition": "all 0.15s"
                },
                "&:nth-child(3)": {
                  "top": "6px",
                  "transition": "all 0.15s"
                },
                "&:nth-child(4)": {
                  "top": "12px",
                  "transition": "all 0.2s"
                }
              }
            },
            "nav.opened .hamburger span": {
              "&:nth-child(1)": {
                "top": "6px",
                "width": "0",
                "opacity": "0",
                "right": "50%",
                "transition": "all 0.2s"
              },
              "&:nth-child(2)": {
                "transform": "rotate(45deg)",
                "transition": "all 0.25s"
              },
              "&:nth-child(3)": {
                "transform": "rotate(-45deg)",
                "transition": "all 0.25s"
              },
              "&:nth-child(4)": {
                "top": "6px",
                "width": "0",
                "opacity": "0",
                "right": "50%",
                "transition": "all 0.2s"
              }
            },
            ".navbar-nav .nav-link": {
              "white-space": "nowrap"
            },
            ".navbar-buttons .btn": {
              "white-space": "nowrap"
            },
            "@media (min-width: 992px) and (max-width: 1399px)": {
              ".navbar-nav .nav-link, .navbar-nav .dropdown-item": {
                "font-size": "14px !important"
              },
              ".navbar-nav .nav-link": {
                "padding-left": ".3em !important",
                "padding-right": ".3em !important"
              },
              ".navbar-buttons .btn": {
                "padding": ".55rem 1rem !important",
                "font-size": "14px !important"
              },
              ".navbar-nav": {
                "margin": "0 !important"
              }
            },
            "@media (min-width: 992px) and (max-width: 1199px)": {
              ".navbar-buttons .btn": {
                "padding": ".5rem .8rem !important",
                "font-size": "13.5px !important"
              }
            }
          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"menu menu1\" group=\"Menu\" plugins=\"DropDown, TouchSwipe\" global once=\"menu\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"fullWidth\" title=\"Full Width\" checked>\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Logo\" name=\"showLogo\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" title=\"Logo Size\" inline name=\"logoSize\" min=\"3\" max=\"8\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"3\" condition=\"showLogo\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Brand Name\" name=\"showBrand\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Contact Phone\" name=\"showPhone\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Contact Address\" name=\"showAddress\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Contact Icons Color\" name=\"iconsContactColor\" value=\"#0c2c68\" condition=\"showPhone || showAddress\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Menu Items\" name=\"showItems\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Icons\" name=\"showIcons\">\n        <select title=\"Amount\" name=\"iconsAmount\" condition=\"showIcons\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\" selected>3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\">4</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Icons Color\" name=\"iconsColor\" value=\"#222222\" condition=\"showIcons\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Button\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n        <header>Styles</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Sticky\" name=\"sticky\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Collapsed\" name=\"collapsed\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Transparent\" name=\"transparent\">\n        <input type=\"range\" title=\"Opacity\" name=\"opacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"transparent\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"menuBgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Hamburger\" name=\"hamburgerColor\" value=\"#222222\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <nav class=\"navbar navbar-dropdown\" mbr-class=\"{'navbar-fixed-top':sticky,\n                 'navbar-expand-lg':!collapsed,\n                 'collapsed':collapsed}\">\n        <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n            <div class=\"brand-container\">\n                <div class=\"navbar-brand\">\n                <span mbr-if=\"showLogo\" class=\"navbar-logo\">\n                    <a href=\"index.html\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/gemini-generated-image-3uwvbn3uwvbn3uwv.png-171x171.png\" alt=\"ZusammenLeben\" mbr-style=\"{'height': logoSize + 'rem'}\">\n                    </a>\n                </span>\n                    <span mbr-if=\"showBrand\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"navbar-caption-wrap\"><a class=\"navbar-caption text-black\" data-app-selector=\".navbar-caption\" href=\"index.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Zusammen Leben</a></span>\n                </div>\n                \n                <!-- פרטי קשר + דגלים (מוצגים אך ורק במחשב) -->\n                <div class=\"contacts-menu desktop-only-flex\">\n                    <div class=\"card-wrap\">\n                        <span class=\"mobi-mbri-phone mobi-mbri\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"></span>\n                        <div class=\"card-box\">\n                            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-0 display-4\"><a href=\"tel:+380 63 700 4615\" class=\"text-primary\">+380 63 700 4615</a></p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <span class=\"menu-divider\">|</span>\n\n                    <div class=\"card-wrap\">\n                        <span class=\"mdi-maps-place\" style=\"font-size: 22px;\"></span>\n                        <div class=\"card-box\">\n                            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-0 display-4\">Konradsreuth Alte Hofer Str. 1</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <span class=\"menu-divider\">|</span>\n\n<div class=\"flags-menu\">\n    <a href=\"de/index.html\" title=\"Deutsch\" class=\"lang-link\">\n        <img src=\"https://flagcdn.com/24x18/de.png\" srcset=\"https://flagcdn.com/48x36/de.png 2x\" alt=\"Germany\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\">\n        <span class=\"lang-code\">DE</span>\n    </a>\n    <span class=\"flag-divider\">|</span>\n    <a href=\"index.html\" title=\"English\" class=\"lang-link\">\n        <img src=\"https://flagcdn.com/24x18/us.png\" srcset=\"https://flagcdn.com/48x36/us.png 2x\" alt=\"United States\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\">\n        <span class=\"lang-code\">EN</span>\n    </a>\n    <span class=\"flag-divider\">|</span>\n    <a href=\"ua/index.html\" title=\"Українська\" class=\"lang-link\">\n        <img src=\"https://flagcdn.com/24x18/ua.png\" srcset=\"https://flagcdn.com/48x36/ua.png 2x\" alt=\"Ukraine\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\">\n        <span class=\"lang-code\">UA</span>\n    </a>\n</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- דגלים בלבד שיופיעו אך ורק בטלפון ליד ההמבורגר -->\n<div class=\"flags-menu mobile-only\">\n    <a href=\"de/index.html\" title=\"Deutsch\" class=\"lang-link\">\n        <img src=\"https://flagcdn.com/24x18/de.png\" alt=\"DE\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\">\n    </a>\n    <span class=\"flag-divider\">|</span>\n    <a href=\"index.html\" title=\"English\" class=\"lang-link\">\n        <img src=\"https://flagcdn.com/24x18/us.png\" alt=\"EN\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\">\n    </a>\n    <span class=\"flag-divider\">|</span>\n    <a href=\"ua/index.html\" title=\"Українська\" class=\"lang-link\">\n        <img src=\"https://flagcdn.com/24x18/ua.png\" alt=\"UA\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\">\n    </a>\n</div>\n                <button class=\"navbar-toggler\" type=\"button\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#navbarSupportedContent\" data-bs-target=\"#navbarSupportedContent\" aria-controls=\"navbarNavAltMarkup\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Toggle navigation\" mbr-if=\"showItems || showIcons || showButtons\">\n                    <div class=\"hamburger\">\n                        <span></span>\n                        <span></span>\n                        <span></span>\n                        <span></span>\n                    </div>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"collapse navbar-collapse\" id=\"navbarSupportedContent\" mbr-scroll-collapse>\n                <ul class=\"navbar-nav nav-dropdown\" data-app-modern-menu=\"true\" mbr-menu><li class=\"nav-item\">\n                        <a class=\"nav-link link display-4 text-primary\" href=\"index.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Home</a>\n                    </li>\n    \n                    <li class=\"nav-item dropdown\">\n                        <a class=\"nav-link link dropdown-toggle display-4 text-primary\" href=\"#\" data-toggle=\"dropdown-submenu\" data-bs-toggle=\"dropdown\" data-bs-auto-close=\"outside\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">About Us</a>\n                        <div class=\"dropdown-menu\">\n                            <a class=\"dropdown-item display-4 text-primary\" href=\"social-activity.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Our Activity</a>\n                            <a class=\"dropdown-item display-4 text-primary\" href=\"anna-shishoili.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Anna Cheishvili</a>\n                        </div>\n                    </li>\n\n                    <li class=\"nav-item\">\n                        <a class=\"nav-link link display-4 text-primary\" href=\"services.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Services</a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"nav-item\">\n                        <a class=\"nav-link link display-4 text-primary\" href=\"request-assistance.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Request Assistance</a>\n                    </li>\n    \n                    <li class=\"nav-item dropdown\">\n                        <a class=\"nav-link link dropdown-toggle display-4 text-primary\" href=\"#\" data-toggle=\"dropdown-submenu\" data-bs-toggle=\"dropdown\" data-bs-auto-close=\"outside\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Living in Germany</a>\n                        <div class=\"dropdown-menu\">\n                            <a class=\"dropdown-item display-4 text-primary\" href=\"glossary.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Glossary</a>\n                            <a class=\"dropdown-item display-4 text-primary\" href=\"learning-german.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learning German</a>\n                            <a class=\"dropdown-item display-4 text-primary\" href=\"refugee-rights.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Rights of Ukrainian Refugees</a>\n                            <a class=\"dropdown-item display-4 text-primary\" href=\"guides.html\">Guides & Articles</a>\n                        </div>\n                    </li>\n\n                    <li class=\"nav-item\">\n                        <a class=\"nav-link link display-4 text-primary\" href=\"areasweserve.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Areas We Serve</a>\n                    </li>\n\n                    <li class=\"nav-item dropdown\">\n                        <a class=\"nav-link link dropdown-toggle display-4 text-primary\" href=\"#\" data-toggle=\"dropdown-submenu\" data-bs-toggle=\"dropdown\" data-bs-auto-close=\"outside\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Community</a>\n                        <div class=\"dropdown-menu\">\n                            <a class=\"dropdown-item display-4 text-primary\" href=\"community.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Our Community</a>\n                            <a class=\"dropdown-item display-4 text-primary\" href=\"family-stories.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Family Stories</a>\n                        </div>\n                    </li>\n\n                    <li class=\"nav-item\">\n                        <a class=\"nav-link link display-4 text-primary\" href=\"faq.html#list01-b\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">FAQ</a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"nav-item\">\n                        <a class=\"nav-link link display-4 text-primary\" href=\"how-to-help.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">How Can you Help</a>\n                    </li>\n    \n                    <!-- Emergency - Highlighted in a separate prominent color -->\n                    <li class=\"nav-item\">\n                        <a class=\"nav-link link font-weight-bold display-4 text-primary\" href=\"emergency.html\" style=\"color: #c81e1e !important;\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Emergency</a>\n                    </li></ul>\n                \n                <div mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"navbar-buttons mbr-section-btn\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary display-4\" href=\"Contact.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Contact Us</a></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n</section>",
